      "lead": [
        "",
        "# `bsc-capability` — the USE layer's data: what a network can DO right now.",
        "#",
        "# The AGGREGATION is lean and pure — the rules take their reads injected, so they are testable without",
        "# four machines and a running app. The READS link their owners' crates (`bsc-project`'s store, `bsc-deploy`'s",
        "# roster) rather than re-invoking `bsc`: inside a run session's sandbox a nested `bsc` is gated to that",
        "# session's surface, so a spawned read came back empty (`a-run-session-directory-carries-its-isolation`)."
